        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: جمنا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جمنا — jamnā — \"to freeze; to set\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر رات کو سردی ہوئی تو پانی جم جائے گا۔ agar rāt ko sardī huī to pānī jam jāe gā. If it is cold tonight, the water will freeze."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): وہ دودھ جم گیا, voh dūdh jam gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جمنا (jamnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin jamnā, \"to coagulate, to freeze\", under Sanskrit yamyátē, \"is held fast\" (CDIAL 10428)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
